   191	arm on Haiku (0.999, above SKILL.state's 0.958) and, on Gemini, is indistinguishable
   192	from ReAct (0.930 against 0.913) and well below SKILL.state (1.000). The same
   193	adjudication describes both — it describes, it does not separate causes, because
