               "      No load-bearing fields. Telemetry never requires an action.\n")
            + ("  maintenance_required - a shelf must be cleared for maintenance work.\n"
               "      Load-bearing field: shelf.\n" if self.apendice_b else "")
            + "\n"
            "ACTIONS\n"
